<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>PipeBill: Invoicing Built for Plumbers</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Send professional invoices from the job site in under 60 seconds. PipeBill is the invoicing tool built for plumbers. Get paid faster, chase less." />
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #0f2a44;
      --blue: #1f6feb;
      --blue-dark: #1655b8;
      --orange: #ff7a1a;
      --light: #f4f7fb;
      --text: #1d2733;
      --muted: #5b6878;
      --radius: 12px;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      background: #fff;
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    .container { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

    /* Nav */
    nav {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e6ebf1;
    }
    nav .container {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      height: 68px;
    }
    .logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--navy); }
    .logo span { color: var(--orange); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 28px; align-items: center; font-weight: 500; }
    .nav-links a:not(.btn) { color: var(--muted); }
    .nav-links a:not(.btn):hover { color: var(--navy); }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 26px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: transform .15s ease, background .15s ease;
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--orange); color: #fff; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #e96a0c; }
    .btn-secondary { background: transparent; color: #fff; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
    .btn-small { padding: 10px 18px; }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy) 0%, #17406b 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 96px 0 110px;
    }
    .hero .container {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center;
    }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(255,122,26,0.15);
      color: #ffb37a;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 3.1rem; line-height: 1.12; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .hero p.lead { font-size: 1.2rem; color: #c9d6e6; margin-bottom: 34px; max-width: 540px; }
    .hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .hero-note { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #9fb2c8; }

    .invoice-mock {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--text);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      transform: rotate(1.5deg);
    }
    .invoice-mock header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .invoice-mock h4 { color: var(--navy); }
    .invoice-mock .tag {
      background: #e6f6ec; color: #1a7f42; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700;
      padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; height: fit-content;
    }
    .line { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed #e1e6ec; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .line.total { border: none; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--navy); padding-top: 16px; }
    .pay-btn {
      margin-top: 18px; background: var(--blue); color: #fff; text-align: center;
      padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* Logos / trust */
    .trust { padding: 40px 0; background: var(--light); text-align: center; color: var(--muted); }
    .trust strong { color: var(--navy); }

    /* Sections */
    section { padding: 96px 0; }
    .section-head { text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 56px; }
    .section-head h2 { font-size: 2.3rem; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 14px; line-height: 1.2; }
    .section-head p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1rem; }

    /* Problem */
    .problems { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
    .problem {
      background: #fff6ef; border-left: 4px solid var(--orange);
      padding: 24px; border-radius: var(--radius);
    }
    .problem h3 { color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .problem p { color: var(--muted); }

    /* Features */
    .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 28px; }
    .feature {
      padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #e6ebf1; border-radius: var(--radius);
      transition: box-shadow .2s ease;
    }
    .feature:hover { box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(15,42,68,0.08); }
    .icon {
      width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px;
      background: #e8f0fe; display: grid; place-items: center;
      font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .feature h3 { color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .feature p { color: var(--muted); }

    /* How it works */
    .how { background: var(--light); }
    .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 32px; counter-reset: step; }
    .step { text-align: center; padding: 0 12px; }
    .step::before {
      counter-increment: step; content: counter(step);
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      width: 56px; height: 56px; margin: 0 auto 18px;
      background: var(--blue); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.3rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }
    .step h3 { color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .step p { color: var(--muted); }

    /* Stats */
    .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; text-align: center; }
    .stat .num { font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--blue); }
    .stat p { color: var(--muted); }

    /* Testimonials */
    .testimonials { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
    .quote {
      background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e6ebf1; border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 28px;
    }
    .quote p { font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .quote .who { font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); }
    .quote .biz { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .stars { color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; }

    /* Pricing */
    .pricing { background: var(--light); }
    .plans { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; }
    .plan {
      background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 34px; border: 1px solid #e6ebf1;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    }
    .plan.featured { border: 2px solid var(--blue); position: relative; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(31,111,235,0.12); }
    .plan.featured::before {
      content: "Most popular"; position: absolute; top: -13px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--blue); color: #fff; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700;
      padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 999px;
    }
    .plan h3 { color: var(--navy); }
    .plan .who-for { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .price { font-size: 2.6rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--navy); }
    .price span { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); }
    .plan ul { list-style: none; margin: 22px 0 28px; flex-grow: 1; }
    .plan li { padding: 7px 0 7px 26px; position: relative; }
    .plan li::before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #1a7f42; font-weight: 800; }
    .plan .btn { text-align: center; }
    .btn-outline { border: 2px solid var(--blue); color: var(--blue); }
    .btn-blue { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; }
    .btn-blue:hover { background: var(--blue-dark); }

    /* FAQ */
    .faq { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; }
    details {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e6ebf1; padding: 20px 0;
    }
    summary {
      cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); font-size: 1.1rem;
      list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    summary::after { content: "+"; font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--blue); }
    details[open] summary::after { content: "–"; }
    details p { margin-top: 12px; color: var(--muted); }

    /* Final CTA */
    .final-cta {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy), #17406b);
      color: #fff; text-align: center;
    }
    .final-cta h2 { font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .final-cta p { color: #c9d6e6; font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 32px; }

    footer { padding: 40px 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
    footer .container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; }
    footer .links { display: flex; gap: 22px; }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero .container, .problems, .features, .steps, .stats, .testimonials, .plans {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.3rem; }
      .invoice-mock { transform: none; }
      .nav-links a:not(.btn) { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <nav>
    <div class="container">
      <a href="#" class="logo">Pipe<span>Bill</span></a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#how">How it works</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
        <a href="#signup" class="btn btn-primary btn-small">Start free trial</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">🔧 Built for plumbers, by people who've crawled under sinks</span>
        <h1>Finish the job. Send the invoice. Get paid before you're back in the van.</h1>
        <p class="lead">PipeBill turns your phone into a billing office. Create a professional invoice in under 60 seconds, take card payments on the spot, and stop chasing customers for money you've already earned.</p>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href="#signup" class="btn btn-primary">Start your free 14-day trial</a>
          <a href="#how" class="btn btn-secondary">See how it works</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-note">No credit card required · Set up in 5 minutes · Cancel anytime</p>
      </div>

      <div class="invoice-mock" aria-hidden="true">
        <header>
          <div>
            <h4>Invoice #1047</h4>
            <small style="color:#5b6878">Henderson Residence · Today</small>
          </div>
          <span class="tag">PAID</span>
        </header>
        <div class="line"><span>Emergency call-out</span><span>$95.00</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span>Replace water heater valve</span><span>$140.00</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span>Parts: ¾" ball valve, fittings</span><span>$38.50</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span>Labor (1.5 hrs)</span><span>$127.50</span></div>
        <div class="line total"><span>Total</span><span>$401.00</span></div>
        <div class="pay-btn">Paid by card · 4 minutes after job</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Trust bar -->
  <div class="trust">
    <div class="container">
      Trusted by <strong>8,000+ plumbing businesses</strong>, from solo operators to 40-truck fleets.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Problem -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>You became a plumber to fix pipes, not do paperwork.</h2>
        <p>But somehow your evenings disappear into invoices, receipts, and awkward "just following up" texts.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problems">
        <div class="problem">
          <h3>Invoices written at the kitchen table</h3>
          <p>You finish a 10-hour day and still have to remember what parts you used on Tuesday.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="problem">
          <h3>Waiting 30, 60, 90 days to get paid</h3>
          <p>Meanwhile you've already paid for the parts, the fuel, and your apprentice's wages.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="problem">
          <h3>Forgotten parts and lost hours</h3>
          <p>Every fitting you forget to bill for is money straight out of your pocket.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features -->
  <section id="features" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Everything you need to bill like a pro</h2>
        <p>No accounting degree required. If you can send a text, you can use PipeBill.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="features">
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>60-second invoices</h3>
          <p>Tap in your labor, pick parts from your saved price list, and send. Done before you've packed your tools.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">💳</div>
          <h3>Get paid on the spot</h3>
          <p>Accept cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and bank transfers right from the invoice. Money lands in your account in 1–2 days.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">🔩</div>
          <h3>Parts & price book</h3>
          <p>Save your common parts, call-out fees, and flat-rate jobs. Update prices once and every new invoice stays current.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">📸</div>
          <h3>Before & after photos</h3>
          <p>Attach photos of the job right to the invoice. Fewer disputes, more trust, and better reviews.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">🔔</div>
          <h3>Automatic reminders</h3>
          <p>PipeBill politely nudges late payers for you, so you never have to make an awkward call again.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">📊</div>
          <h3>Tax-time ready</h3>
          <p>Syncs with QuickBooks, Xero, and FreshBooks. Hand your accountant a clean report, not a shoebox of receipts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">📝</div>
          <h3>Quotes that convert</h3>
          <p>Send a quote, get a digital signature, and turn it into an invoice with one tap when the job's done.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">📴</div>
          <h3>Works without signal</h3>
          <p>In a basement or crawlspace? Build invoices offline and they'll send automatically when you're back in range.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">👷</div>
          <h3>Built for teams</h3>
          <p>Give your techs their own logins. See who invoiced what, track jobs by truck, and keep pricing consistent.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <section id="how" class="how">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>From finished job to paid invoice in 3 steps</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <h3>Finish the job</h3>
          <p>Open PipeBill, select the customer, and add labor and parts from your price book.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>Send the invoice</h3>
          <p>Text or email a branded, professional invoice with your logo and license number.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>Get paid</h3>
          <p>Your customer pays with one tap. You get a notification and move on to the next call.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="num">3x</div>
          <p>faster payment on average vs. paper invoices</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="num">6 hrs</div>
          <p>of admin saved per week, per plumber</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="num">12%</div>
          <p>more revenue captured from previously unbilled parts</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Testimonials -->
  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Plumbers who stopped chasing payments</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonials">
        <div class="quote">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p>"I used to spend every Sunday doing invoices. Now I send them from the driveway before I leave. Got my weekends back."</p>
          <div class="who">Mike R.</div>
          <div class="biz">Owner, Rivera Plumbing & Drain</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quote">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p>"Half my customers pay before I've even pulled away from the curb. My cash flow has never been better."</p>
          <div class="who">Dana K.</div>
          <div class="biz">Master Plumber, KD Plumbing Services</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quote">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p>"We run 12 trucks. PipeBill keeps every tech's pricing consistent and I can see exactly what's outstanding at a glance."</p>
          <div class="who">Tom B.</div>
          <div class="biz">Operations Manager, Blue Line Plumbing</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing -->
  <section id="pricing" class="pricing">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Simple pricing. No surprises.</h2>
        <p>Every plan includes a 14-day free trial. Switch or cancel anytime.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="plans">
        <div class="plan">
          <h3>Solo</h3>
          <p class="who-for">For the one-van operation</p>
          <div class="price">$19<span>/month</span></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Unlimited invoices & quotes</li>
            <li>Card & bank payments</li>
            <li>Parts & price book</li>
            <li>Automatic reminders</li>
            <li>1 user</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#signup" class="btn btn-outline">Start free trial</a>
        </div>
        <div class="plan featured">
          <h3>Crew</h3>
          <p class="who-for">For growing shops</p>
          <div class="price">$49<span>/month</span></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Everything in Solo</li>
            <li>Up to 5 users</li>
            <li>Job photos & signatures</li>
            <li>QuickBooks & Xero sync</li>
            <li>Custom branding</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#signup" class="btn btn-blue">Start free trial</a>
        </div>
        <div class="plan">
          <h3>Fleet</h3>
          <p class="who-for">For multi-truck businesses</p>
          <div class="price">$99<span>/month</span></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Everything in Crew</li>
            <li>Unlimited users</li>
            <li>Per-truck & per-tech reports</li>
            <li>Role-based permissions</li>
            <li>Priority phone support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#signup" class="btn btn-outline">Start free trial</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Questions? We've got answers.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq">
        <details>
          <summary>Do I need to be good with computers?</summary>
          <p>Not at all. PipeBill is designed for use on your phone with big buttons and simple screens. Most plumbers send their first invoice within 5 minutes of signing up.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What are the payment processing fees?</summary>
          <p>Card payments are 2.7% + 30¢ per transaction. Bank transfers (ACH) are a flat 1%, capped at $10. You can also choose to pass fees on to your customer.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I import my existing customers and price list?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Upload a spreadsheet or connect your accounting software and we'll bring everything over. Our support team can do it for you, free.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Does it work on iPhone and Android?</summary>
          <p>Yes. PipeBill works on iPhone, Android, tablets, and any web browser, and everything syncs automatically.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What happens after my free trial?</summary>
          <p>You choose a plan that fits. If you don't, your account simply pauses. No surprise charges, and your data stays safe for 90 days.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Is my data secure?</summary>
          <p>Absolutely. We use bank-level 256-bit encryption, and payments are processed by PCI-compliant partners. We never sell your data or your customers' data.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section id="signup" class="final-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Stop doing paperwork at midnight.</h2>
      <p>Join 8,000+ plumbers who get paid faster with PipeBill.</p>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Start your free 14-day trial</a>
      <p class="hero-note" style="margin-top:18px">No credit card required · Set up in 5 minutes</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <div>© 2026 PipeBill, Inc. All rights reserved.</div>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="#">Privacy</a>
        <a href="#">Terms</a>
        <a href="#">Support</a>
        <a href="#">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
```
